    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## AI Chat Helper\r\n\r\n**Do This:** Use AI Chat to plan your app logic before coding. Ask for help mapping your decisions, inputs, and outcomes, or checking if your flowchart covers all possible paths.\r\n\r\n**Try Asking:**\r\n\r\n* *\"Can you help me choose two decisions for [x]?\"*\r\n* *\"What could be good inputs and outcomes for [x]?\"*\r\n* *\"Can you check if my four leaves are all reachable?\"*\r\n* *\"How can I make my decision labels clearer?\"*\r\n* *\"How do I write a test cases that covers every outcome?\"*\r\n\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
